# Data & models (local cache, not committed)
# Leading slash restricts to repo root so src/wise_investor/data/ is NOT matched.
# We exclude /data/* (children) rather than /data/ itself so the calibration
# manifest can be re-included via negation — git won't re-include a file
# whose parent directory is fully excluded.
/data/*
# Calibration manifest is config, not output — keep it tracked so back-validation
# tests + the runner CLI work on a clean clone (constitution v2.0 §22).
!/data/calibration/
/data/calibration/*
!/data/calibration/manifest.yaml
# peer audit snapshots are evidence for manifest comments — track them.
!/data/calibration/peer_audit_*.yaml
# Calibration baselines (curated ledger snapshots) are tracked so cross-
# revision comparisons survive a clean clone. Per-run ledger output
# under /data/calibration_ledger/ stays untracked.
!/data/calibration_baselines/
/data/calibration_baselines/*
!/data/calibration_baselines/*.json
!/data/calibration_baselines/*.md
chroma_db/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

